<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερέ-πονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing toil and trouble,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπλακίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bearing toil</i> or <i>hardship, patient thereof,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς μάχαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Gall.</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ. τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.149d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1488.44
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Mith.</u>
					74
				</span></i>
			.</div>
